- Request LIBTOOL to be used
- Set topbuildir based on a Makefile variable to call libtool
- Use /usr/local instead of /var for xfstest final location
- Move macros from aclocal.m4 to acinclude.m4, aclocal.m4 is autogenerated.

TEST=3DCompile in chromeOS chroot.
TEST=3DUsing a snippet of build-all at https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2=
/url?u=3Dhttps-3A__github.com_tytso_xfstests-2Dbld&d=3DDwIBAg&c=3DRoP1YumCX=
CgaWHvlZYR8PQcxBKCX5YTpkKY057SbK10&r=3D-yMrTV4jriXR7ieyzzjV-QgHBD0UDw8ixoR7=
7aMeAHE&m=3DVdzD4uuj5Zks7OsGcUBKCHDDJig5g9qTLjbRfNI6wd0&s=3D6l8TxAqq_8ZTrjD=
LZIBViElUbXQKiiDmRP5ZUFGC44c&e=3D=20
After adding config.sub and config.guess with:
cp /usr/share/misc/config.sub /usr/share/misc/config.guess
Verified that compilation of xfstest works:
ver=3D$(git describe --always --dirty); echo "xfstests       $ver ($(git lo=
g -1 --pretty=3D%cD))" > ../xfstests.ver ;
autoheader ; autoconf ;
CFLAGS=3D"$LCF -I$DESTDIR/include -fno-stack-protector"
CPPFLAGS=3D"-I$DESTDIR/include"
LDFLAGS=3D"$LLF -static -L$DESTDIR/lib"
LIBS=3D-lpthread
./configure
make -j40 LLDFLAGS=3D$EXEC_LLDFLAGS LIBTOOL=3D"/usr/bin/libtool --tag=3DCC"=
 BUILD_VERBOSE=3D1

Signed-off-by: Gwendal Grignou <gwendal@chromium.org>
